# Generated audit output — reproducible, not source.
#
# Everything below is overwritten by the next run:
#   zozi_audit.py      -> zozi_forensic_audit.md, logs/*.jsonl, logs/facts.json
#   zozi_compile.py    -> zozi_remediation_plan.md
#   zozi_verify.py     -> zozi_verification.md, logs/verdicts.jsonl
#   zz_core/summary.py -> AUDIT_RESULT.md
#
# Tracking them meant every audit run committed ~2.6 MB of markdown and ~1.9 MB of
# JSONL that the following run immediately replaced. The files stay on disk for
# reading; they just stop being versioned.
#
# NOT ignored, because these are source or a durable hand-off:
#   AUDIT_RESULT.md      - the single file to read for the current result
#   AUDIT_SUITE_PLAN.md  - the plan and the defect log behind each engine fix
#   PLAN.md- engine input
#   *.py, tests/         - the engine

# Full per-finding evidence dumps (1.8 MB, 867 KB)
zozi_forensic_audit.md
zozi_remediation_plan.md
zozi_verification.md

# Machine-readable run output
logs/
!logs/.gitkeep

# Byte-code
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Probe scratch
_probe_*.jsonl
*.tmp
*.tmp.*